# Output Format
Respond with a single JSON object exactly matching this schema and nothing else:

{"utterance": "<what the patient says out loud, in plain English prose>"}

The "utterance" field must contain natural spoken dialogue only —
no stage directions, no internal thoughts, no labels, no markdown,
no nested objects, no clinician reply, no narration.
One speaker turn per response.
